      "id": "packages_cache_agents_single_flight_wrap",
      "label": "Single-Flight CacheService.wrap",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Concurrent misses per key share one factory execution and rejection to prevent stampedes; failed runs leave no cached entry so subsequent calls retry.",
